(1024: 16.7/16.7/8.3; 4096: at the floor), the shuffled floor ~0-8%, and untrained
chance 16.7%. Real recall past the window, holding at 8x the window (4096), with a
distance gradient (recall rises as the needle nears the query). Honest bound: a
learned lossy top-K memory read on a 0.98B-token (undertrained) model, so ~40-58%
(not attention's in-window 100%) is the expected shape; expect it to sharpen with
more training. Controls all green: shuffled at floor, untrained at chance, argmax
diverse (no degenerate single-token collapse). Fix required to run: exp_needle_recall
_clone_bb had to learn the memory decode-state shape (commit 9e07375).
